			"notes": "Initial Release!\n\nWe hope you enjoy these three origins! They're cut-down TMO origins, but in effect they're practically remixed Avian, Dryad, and Wildling. Names and descriptions aren't final! We're still pondering them.\n\nWe think these are fun toys to play with alongside Origins-, but we'll admit they're roughly at the level of polish of Origins- 1.0, not 2.0! Over time we'll keep playing around with them, and if the inspiration to give them that level of polish strikes us, we'll give it a shot.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sisby-folk/toomanyoriginsminus/commits/v1.0.0"
